{"sourceUrl":"https://hyxy.dlut.edu.cn//info/1591/32592.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:16.508673+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://hyxy.dlut.edu.cn//info/1591/32592.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span>大连理工大学化工海洋与生命学院</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生预报名系统已开通，诚邀全国各高校</span><span>2027</span><span>届推荐免试生申报我院。有意向报考我院的同学可登录</span><span>“</span><span>大连理工大学接收推荐免试攻读研究生预报名系统</span><span>”</span><span>，报名网址</span><span><span>：</span><span><a href=\"https://yjszs.dlut.edu.cn/zsbm/logon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span></span></span></a><a href=\"https://yjszs.dlut.edu.cn/zsbm/logon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://yjszs.dlut.edu.cn/zsbm/logon</span></a></span></span><span>。有关事项说明如下：</span></p><p><span>一、报名条件</span></p><p><span>申请者应为预计能够获得本科所在高校</span><span>2027</span><span>年推荐免试资格的应届毕业生，如未获得本科所在高校</span><span>2027</span><span>年推荐免试资格申请者的考核结果无效。</span></p><p><span>二、报名时间</span></p><p><span>报名时间为</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>13</span><span>日</span><span>12:00-2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>17</span><span>日</span><span>24:00</span></p><p><span>三、报名方式</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>、申请者登录</span><span>“</span><span>我校接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span><span>前须仔细阅读系统中的申请须知，并认真按照其要求完成申报；</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>、申请者须在报名系统中提交以下材料：</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）本科学习期间成绩单</span><span>,</span><span></span><span>需加盖学校（或学院）教务部门的公章；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）本科学习期间排名证明材料</span><span>,</span><span></span><span>需加盖学校（或学院）教务部门的公章；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）其他证明材料（如：英语四、六级<span>证明</span>，发表论文、专利，竞赛等各类获奖或资格证书等）。</span></p><p><span>四、报名审核</span></p><p><span>我院根据考生报名情况进行集中审核，预计于</span><span>9</span><span>月下旬在系统中通知考生审核结果，请注意查看。</span></p><p><span>待国家系统正式开通后，所有推免申请者（含已参加我校推免预报名）均须在</span><span>“</span><span>全国推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>中申报我院，未在规定时间申报者前期申报审核无效。</span></p><p><span>五、联系方式</span></p><p><span>联系人：陈</span> <span>茜</span></p><p><span>电</span><span> </span><span>话：</span><span>0427-2631844</span></p><p><span>邮</span><span> </span><span>箱：</span><span><a href=\"mailto:chenxi123226@dlut.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>chenxi123226@dlut.edu.cn</span></a></span></p><p><span>若本通知与学校或上级单位发布的新规定不符，按照学校或上级单位发布的新规定执行。</span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"bc2d6cd028761e649023d158896f9999dd7152dd536f4eb88a33445355d3c102","textLength":657,"sourceSha256":"f434ab8b35525a395385903d59c0806b45bf79932ec08012ec132f3ba93108cf","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-1829ebd80be8894ded8e","title":"2026年大连理工大学化工海洋与生命学院2027年接收推荐免试研究生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:16.508673+00:00"}
